                      "content": "1 · Urutan keyboard & fokus",
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 15,
                      "fontWeight": "bold"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "CXE5u",
                      "name": "Card Line",
                      "fill": "#3A3F44",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "· Urutan tab mengikuti urutan visual: sidebar → topbar (badge, clock, user menu) → banner → judul halaman → aksi utama → tabel → pagination.",
                      "lineHeight": 1.55,
                      "fontFamily": "Roboto Mono",
                      "fontSize": 10.5,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "O0MDq",
                      "name": "Card Line",
                      "fill": "#3A3F44",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "· Skip link langsung ke konten utama; tombol ≡ sidebar memakai aria-expanded + aria-controls.",
                      "lineHeight": 1.55,
                      "fontFamily": "Roboto Mono",
                      "fontSize": 10.5,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "aKTqD",
                      "name": "Card Line",
                      "fill": "#3A3F44",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "· Modal konfirmasi hapus: fokus pindah ke dialog dan terkunci di dalamnya, Escape = Batal, fokus kembali ke tombol pemicu.",
                      "lineHeight": 1.55,
                      "fontFamily": "Roboto Mono",
                      "fontSize": 10.5,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "vL1OS",
                      "name": "Card Line",
                      "fill": "#3A3F44",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "· Drawer mobile: fokus pindah ke drawer saat dibuka, Escape / tap backdrop menutup, fokus kembali ke tombol ≡.",
                      "lineHeight": 1.55,
                      "fontFamily": "Roboto Mono",
                      "fontSize": 10.5,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "wmqtL",
                      "name": "Card Line",
                      "fill": "#3A3F44",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "· Semua aksi baris tabel berupa tombol/link sungguhan — tidak ada aksi yang hanya bisa diklik mouse.",
