                      "name": "Card Line",
                      "fill": "#3A3F44",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "· Teks utama ≥ 4,5:1 terhadap latar; teks besar/label ≥ 3:1; garis, ikon, dan batas komponen (UI) ≥ 3:1.",
