                      "name": "Card Line",
                      "fill": "#3A3F44",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "· Mode cetak grayscale: laporan tetap terbaca tanpa warna (header tebal + garis pemisah antar baris).",
