                      "name": "Card Line",
                      "fill": "#3A3F44",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "· Kejadian kritis (Alat Terputus, ambang terlewati): role=alert / aria-live=assertive hanya sekali per kejadian.",
