          "gap": 16,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "pFIcg",
              "name": "Sec label",
              "fill": "#1A1A1A",
              "content": "A · SITEMAP — every screen, role access, navigation placement",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "700",
              "letterSpacing": 1.5
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "p3GoPK",
              "name": "Tabs note",
              "fill": "#5A5A5A",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "BOTTOM TAB BAR — [admin]: Dashboard · Sensor Real-Time · Water Control · CCTV · Tanam Saya · Laporan · Asisten AI (≤5 tampil, sisanya drawer)  |   [petani]: Dashboard · Sensor Real-Time · Tanam Saya · CCTV · Asisten AI   |   [demo]: sama seperti admin, destructive disabled + banner. Semua tujuan lain via NAVIGATION DRAWER (hamburger).",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "Geist",
              "fontSize": 12,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "jTGw9",
              "name": "Tree",
              "fill": "#2A2A2A",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "00 · AUTH & PROFILE\n├── Login (username + password)                        [public]  · drill-in, no chrome\n└── Profil                                             [admin][petani][demo] · drawer › Sistem\n    ├── Edit Profil (form)                             · drill-in (back stack)\n    ├── Ganti Password (form)                          · drill-in (back stack)\n    └── Keluar (logout, confirm sheet)                 · drawer / user menu overflow\n\n01 · IKHTISAR\n└── Dashboard                                          [admin][petani][demo] · BOTTOM TAB #1\n    ├── connection status badge (online/anomaly/offline) · live in [top app bar]\n    ├── hero welcome + 3 quick actions                 · in-screen\n    ├── 6 metric cards (pH, Suhu Air Tandon, TDS, Suhu Udara, Kelembapan, Tandon Air)\n    ├── crop pipeline 4 stage cards + total varietas   · in-screen\n    └── average sensor table → card list + latest alert list · in-screen, pull-to-refresh\n\n01B · ASISTEN AI\n└── Asisten AI — Chat                                  [admin][petani][demo] · BOTTOM TAB #5 [admin] / drawer [petani]\n    ├── panel chat (bubble user/asisten · quick prompts) · in-screen, streaming per-kalimat\n    ├── konteks percakapan (sensor live · riwayat)       · in-screen banner + checkbox\n    └── guard peran + rate-limit + AI offline            · state inline + snackbar\n\n02 · KEBUN & SENSOR\n├── Sensor Real-Time                                   [admin][petani][demo] · BOTTOM TAB #2\n│   ├── chart per parameter (6 params, range selector) · in-screen tabs/segment\n│   ├── tarik data historis                            · bottom sheet\n│   └── export CSV                                     · system share sheet\n├── Water Control                                      [admin][demo read-only] · BOTTOM TAB #3 [admin]\n    ├── tank/katup status + polling                    · in-screen\n    ├── mode toggle AUTO/MANUAL                        · in-screen\n    └── Isi Air / Stop + last command timestamp        · in-screen buttons\n├── CCTV (ruang greenhouse)                            [admin][petani][demo] · BOTTOM TAB #4 [admin] / drawer [petani]\n│   ├── grid kamera (feed live · status · resolusi)     · in-screen, 3-col → 1-col adaptive\n│   ├── pemutar kamera terpilih (rekam · snapshot)      · in-screen / full-screen\n│   └── log peristiwa kamera                            · in-screen, live region\n\n03 · SIKLUS TANAM\n├── Tanam Saya                                         [admin][petani][demo] · BOTTOM TAB #4\n│   ├── list active plantings                          · list rows, pull-to-refresh\n│   ├── Mulai Tanam (FAB) · Selesai per stage · Hapus (confirm sheet)\n├── Data Tahap — Semai                                 [admin][demo] · drawer › Siklus Tanam\n│   ├── list [tabs: Aktif | Yang Selesai] + FAB Mulai Semai Baru\n│   ├── Form Semai (create & edit, route terpisah)      · full-screen form\n│   ├── Detail per batch (show)                        · drill-in\n│   └── Hapus                                          · confirm bottom sheet\n├── Data Tahap — Peremajaan CRUD                       [admin][demo] · drawer — list / form / show / delete\n├── Data Tahap — Pendewasaan CRUD                      [admin][demo] · drawer — list / form / show / delete\n├── Data Tahap — Panen CRUD                            [admin][demo] · drawer — list / form / show / delete\n└── Durasi Siklus                                      [admin][demo] · drawer — CRUD + export CSV (share sheet)\n\n04 · MASTER DATA                                       [admin][demo] · drawer\n├── Jenis Tanaman CRUD                                 — list / form / show / delete\n├── Meja Tanaman CRUD                                  — list / form / show / delete\n└── Ambang Sensor CRUD (min/max per parameter)         — list / form / show / delete → feeds ESP32 + flag anomaly\n\n05 · LAPORAN & NOTIFIKASI                              [admin][demo] · drawer\n├── Laporan (matrix)                                   — filter rentang/tahap/parameter · export CSV · share as PDF\n└── Notifikasi WhatsApp                                — settings form (API key + endpoint) · [Kirim Uji] · list tipe pesan alert\n\n06 · SISTEM                                            · drawer\n├── Profil (lihat 00)                                  [admin][petani][demo]\n├── Manajemen User                                     [admin][demo] · CRUD, level admin/petani, flag demo\n└── Keluar                                             [admin][petani][demo] · confirm sheet\n\n12 · ALERTS (sistem, bukan halaman)                     [admin][petani][demo]\n├── banner offline/anomaly di [top app bar] · toast+snackbar sukses/error\n└── alert log (type, value, relative time) = daftar di Dashboard + live region\n\n13 · GLOBAL CHROME (every authenticated screen)\n├── [status bar] · [top app bar: hamburger + judul dinamis + brand line + status device + clock + user menu ⋮]\n├── [bottom tab bar] (role-visible) · [FAB] untuk create utama\n└── back navigation stack untuk drill-in (detail/form/show) · drawer overlay grups",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "Geist",
              "fontSize": 12.5,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        },
